&lt;p&gt;Chowbus is a leading AI-powered restaurant technology SaaS platform with deep roots in the North American market.&amp;nbsp;We support thousands of restaurants of every size across the U.S. and Canada, with technology solutions spanning&amp;nbsp;POS, AI, and digital tools that help restaurants run more efficiently and grow their business. We compete with&amp;nbsp;companies like Toast, Square, Clover, and Menusifu. Our Marketing team plays a direct role in that growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Digital Marketing Manager to own Chowbus&#39;s digital presence end to end: organic search, our&amp;nbsp;website, marketing analytics, and paid search. You&#39;ll turn data into decisions and help restaurant owners find Chowbus&amp;nbsp;and book a demo. You&#39;ll work closely with fellow Marketing team members, Sales colleagues, and Product specialists&amp;nbsp;to keep our digital funnel consistent from first click to conversion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;
